---
import { FLOW_EVENTS } from '../data/espdeck';

const first = FLOW_EVENTS[0];
---

<section class="section how" id="jak" aria-labelledby="how-title" data-flow-root data-route={first?.route}>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="how-title" class="h2 how-h">Deck je středem sítě</h2>

    <div class="net">
      <div class="node node--audio" data-node="audio">
        <h3>Bluesound</h3>
        <p>BluOS HTTP API, port 11000</p>
      </div>
      <div class="node node--lights" data-node="lights">
        <h3>Světla</h3>
        <p>Lokální server, port 8181</p>
      </div>

      <div class="link link--audio" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
      <div class="link link--lights" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>

      <div class="node node--deck">
        <h3>ESP32-S3 deck</h3>
        <p>Síť a spojení s PC běží v samostatných úlohách FreeRTOS na jádře 0. Displej na ně nikdy nečeká.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="link link--pc" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>

      <div class="node node--pc" data-node="pc">
        <h3>espdeck.exe</h3>
        <p>TCP 4545, JSON po řádcích. Deck najde přes mDNS jako _espdeck._tcp a zmáčkne zkratku přes enigo.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flow">
      <div class="flow-btns" role="group" aria-label="Vyber událost">
        {FLOW_EVENTS.map((e, i) => (
          <button
            class="flow-btn"
            type="button"
            aria-pressed={i === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}
            data-flow={e.id}
            data-route={e.route}
            data-out={e.out}
            data-back={e.back}
          >{e.label}</button>
        ))}
      </div>
      <dl class="flow-log">
        <div><dt>Odchází z decku</dt><dd><code data-flow-out>{first?.out}</code></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Vrací se</dt><dd><code data-flow-back>{first?.back}</code></dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <p class="how-note">Deck posílá jen události. Co se má na počítači stát, ví jen aplikace.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how {
    background: var(--bg-2);
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .how-h {
    max-width: none;
  }
  .net {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 3fr) minmax(40px, 1fr) minmax(0, 4fr) minmax(40px, 1fr) minmax(0, 3fr);
    grid-template-rows: auto auto;
    grid-template-areas:
      'audio laudio deck lpc pc'
      'lights llights deck lpc pc';
    gap: 12px 0;
    margin-top: clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);
  }
  .node {
    padding: 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
    background: var(--bg);
    transition: border-color 200ms var(--ease-out);
  }
  .node h3 {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
  }
  .node p {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--fg-2);
  }
  .node--audio { grid-area: audio; }
  .node--lights { grid-area: lights; }
  .node--pc { grid-area: pc; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
  .node--deck {
    grid-area: deck;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--copper);
    border-color: var(--copper);
    color: var(--copper-ink);
  }
  .node--deck p {
    color: inherit;
  }
  .link {
    position: relative;
    align-self: center;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--line-2);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .link i {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 auto 0 0;
    width: 40%;
    background: var(--copper-2);
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .link--audio { grid-area: laudio; }
  .link--lights { grid-area: llights; }
  .link--pc { grid-area: lpc; }

  [data-route='audio'] .node--audio,
  [data-route='lights'] .node--lights,
  [data-route='pc'] .node--pc {
    border-color: var(--copper-2);
  }
  [data-route='audio'] .link--audio,
  [data-route='lights'] .link--lights,
  [data-route='pc'] .link--pc {
    background: var(--copper-2);
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    [data-run][data-route='audio'] .link--audio i,
    [data-run][data-route='lights'] .link--lights i {
      background: var(--fg);
      animation: packet-left 620ms var(--ease-out);
    }
    [data-run][data-route='pc'] .link--pc i {
      background: var(--fg);
      animation: packet-right 620ms var(--ease-out);
    }
  }
  @keyframes packet-left {
    from { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(260%); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(-100%); }
  }
  @keyframes packet-right {
    from { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(-100%); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(260%); }
  }

  .flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr);
    gap: 24px clamp(24px, 4vw, 64px);
    margin-top: clamp(24px, 3vw, 40px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .flow-btns {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .flow-btn {
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
    background: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background-color 150ms var(--ease-out),
      border-color 150ms var(--ease-out),
      color 150ms var(--ease-out);
  }
  .flow-btn:hover {
    border-color: var(--fg-3);
  }
  .flow-btn[aria-pressed='true'] {
    background: var(--fg);
    border-color: var(--fg);
    color: var(--bg);
  }
  .flow-log {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .flow-log div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(110px, 1fr) minmax(0, 3fr);
    gap: 4px 16px;
  }
  .flow-log dt {
    color: var(--fg-3);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    padding-top: 2px;
  }
  .flow-log dd {
    margin: 0;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .flow-log code {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .how-note {
    margin-top: clamp(24px, 3vw, 40px);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    max-width: 44ch;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .net {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      grid-template-rows: none;
      grid-template-areas: 'audio' 'laudio' 'lights' 'llights' 'deck' 'lpc' 'pc';
      gap: 0;
    }
    .link {
      justify-self: center;
      width: 2px;
      height: 28px;
    }
    .link i {
      inset: 0 0 auto 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 40%;
    }
    .link--lights {
      height: 28px;
    }
    [data-run][data-route] .link i {
      animation: none;
      opacity: 1;
    }
    .flow {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .flow-log div {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
